RecoverFundsTest
├── when initializer is unregistered (migrationBlock is 0)
│   └── it reverts with {Unregistered}
├── when initializer was already migrated
│   └── it reverts with {AlreadyConsumed}
├── when initializer was already recovered
│   └── it reverts with {AlreadyConsumed}
├── when caller is not the leftoverRecipient
│   └── it reverts with {UnauthorizedRecovery}
├── when block.number is LT migrationBlock + recoveryDelayBlocks
│   └── it reverts with {RecoveryNotYetAllowed}
└── when called by leftoverRecipient at or past the unlock block on a live initializer
    ├── it transfers supplyForLP from the strategy to leftoverRecipient
    ├── it sweeps the initializer's raised currency to leftoverRecipient
    ├── it zeroes reserves so neither migrate nor recoverFunds can run again
    └── it emits {FundsRecovered}
